title Cassette Bluetooth (T4, synthetic names): a take playing through a headset without a music mode: the one-time notice "Playing in call quality: this headset has no music mode."
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO playing
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT callq
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "Playing in call quality: this headset has no music mode."
shot callq
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
